cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this proof archive, please cite it."
title: "The Minimum Order of Nonunimodal Independence Polynomials at Prescribed Independence Number"
authors:
  - given-names: Yongxian
    family-names: Zhang
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "With independence number fixed at r, the minimum graph order for a nonunimodal independence polynomial is r + Theta(sqrt(r)), both among all graphs and among connected graphs. The constants in the bounds are not claimed optimal."
